  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Centre for Investigative Reporting, CIN 2016-2019 - Centre for Investigative Reporting, CIN</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Centre for Investigative Reporting, CIN 2016-2019</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Budgetst&#xf6;d till Centre for Investigative Reporting, CIN, en nyhetsbyr&#xe5; i BiH som arbetar med unders&#xf6;kande journalistik. Insatsen bidrar till att bek&#xe4;mpa korruption i BiH genom unders&#xf6;kande reportage, som i vissa fall leder till utredningar av Myndigheten mot korruption eller av polis och &#xe5;klagare. Reportagen &#xe5;terpubliceras ocks&#xe5; i m&#xe5;nga medier.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to Centre for Investigative reporting, CIN,  a news agency for investigative journalism. The contribution enables an institutional development of CIN for a further efficient delivery of investigative journalism. CINs reports contributes to combating corruption i BiH through its reporting which in some cases lead to investigations by BiH anti-corruption Agency or police /prosecutors. The reports are also republished in many of the mainstream media in the region.
 
.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The core support is aimed at institutional development of CIN to enable a high quality investigative journalism. CIN is one of the few organisations in Bosnia and Herzegvoina (BiH) which is doing this kind of reporting and with seemingly a very high degree of quality. This statement is confirmed not just by their own reporting submitted, and by our own assessment but from other independent parties and sources in the country. &#xa0;&#xa0;The outcome level relates to improvement of institutional capacities in order to reach investigative reporting at international standards that can have an impact on advocacy efforts for legislative changes or judicial actions taken upon CIN&apos;s stores and products. Over the years CIN has further improved its ability to hire staff of a good quality and to become even better in fact scrutiny in order to secure accuracy in their reporting. Hence they have been able to build trust and reliability as a source of information to a wider audience, internally as well as externally.&#xa0;Expected outcome is also described in terms of young reporters capacitated for investigative reporting and reaching a higher degree of budget secured through commercial income.</narrative>
  </description>
